     "name": "ITC Limited (Agri Business)",
     "hq": "India",
     "iso": "IND",
     "src": "itcltd",
     "flag": "sourced",
     "metric": "~9.8% share of India's rice exports (Feb 2025); supplies basmati & non-basmati to the Gulf, US, SE Asia and EU.",
     "sourcing": [
      "IND"
     ],
     "note": "India's largest single rice exporter by share; sources paddy across Indian states and ships premium basmati and bulk non-basmati. Directly exposed to India's export-policy switches.",
     "improve": "Concentration in a single origin (India) makes ITC's rice book highly sensitive to New Delhi's ban/MEP/duty changes — it should disclose how it hedges policy risk."
    },
