     "note": "One of the 'ABCD'. Soybean crushing across the US, South America and the EU; oilseed margins compressed in 2024 on abundant supply (ADM 10-K).",
     "improve": "ADM should break out soy-origination by biome and report EUDR-readiness for its South American supply, plus per-region crush-margin sensitivity, so investors can separate its US-feedstock business from its Brazil/Argentina deforestation-linked exposure."
